    skos:prefLabel "Neem Oil"@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "Document-attested minor 19th-century commodity absent as a standalone line in Layer-1 British/Canadian customs ledgers; typically subsumed under htc:0124 (Oil Unenumerated). Attested in: P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 270, P. L. Simmonds, The Commercial Dictionary of Trade Products (1892), scan p. 488."@en ;
